OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly rain soon clearing to a
OL,6,Fbrighter, fresher-feeling day, with
OL,7,Fsome warm sunny spells and a north-
OL,8,Fwesterly wind. Cloudier at times in
OL,9,Fthe west, with isolated showers
OL,10,Fpossible.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with further showers
OL,13,Fover western hills, elsewhere mostly
OL,14,Fdry with clear spells. Wind easing
OL,15,Flight inland but breezy near the coast.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FStaying cloudy with the odd
OL,18,Flight shower over western hills
OL,19,Fhowever elsewhere will be mostly dry
OL,20,Fwith bright or sunny spells. Moderate
OL,21,Fwesterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
